    <task id="Id_a5f6f67a-f785-42b7-bae6-ef0d6840bd8f" name="7.3 Confirm the contract supervisor and manager">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 117. A execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contrato dever&amp;aacute; ser acompanhada e fiscalizada por 1 (um) ou mais fiscais docontrato, representantes da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o especialmente designados conforme requisitos estabelecidos no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;art. 7&amp;ordm;desta Lei&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, ou pelos respectivos substitutos, permitida a contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de terceiros para assisti-los e subsidi&amp;aacute;-los cominforma&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es pertinentes a essa atribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 1&amp;ordm; O fiscal do contrato anotar&amp;aacute; em registro pr&amp;oacute;prio todas as ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncias relacionadas &amp;agrave; execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contrato,determinando o que for necess&amp;aacute;rio para a regulariza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o das faltas ou dos defeitos observados.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 2&amp;ordm; O fiscal do contrato informar&amp;aacute; a seus superiores, em tempo h&amp;aacute;bil para a ado&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o das medidas convenientes,a situa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o que demandar decis&amp;atilde;o ou provid&amp;ecirc;ncia que ultrapasse sua compet&amp;ecirc;ncia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 3&amp;ordm; O fiscal do contrato ser&amp;aacute; auxiliado pelos &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;os de assessoramento jur&amp;iacute;dico e de controle interno daAdministra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, que dever&amp;atilde;o dirimir d&amp;uacute;vidas e subsidi&amp;aacute;-lo com informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es relevantes para prevenir riscos naexecu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o contratual.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_f51b8626-baff-4299-98fb-912c04e3cabe</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_268f0d4e-1f17-410c-90c0-de6726db6296</outgoing>
